    <string name="exp_title">Experimental features</string>
    <string name="exp_banner">Experimental. May not work well, may change or disappear in future versions. Use at your own risk.</string>
    <string name="exp_nearby">Unlock automatically when nearby</string>
    <string name="exp_nearby_sub">Over Bluetooth or on the same network, without touching the phone (never over Tailscale). Risk: someone next to the computer can unlock it.</string>
    <string name="exp_notification">Unlock from the notification</string>
    <string name="exp_notification_sub">Unlock button in the notification, without biometrics. Risk: anyone who picks up the unlocked phone can unlock.</string>
    <string name="exp_watch">Amazfit watch (fake call)</string>
    <string name="exp_watch_sub">The request shows up on the watch as a call: ignore unlocks, decline denies. When the watch is off the wrist, the action is blocked. Requires Gadgetbridge Voz paired with the watch. Risk: anyone wearing your watch can unlock.</string>
    <string name="exp_wear">Wear OS watch</string>
    <string name="exp_wear_sub">The request shows up on the watch (Galaxy Watch, Pixel Watch and others) with Unlock and Deny; the tile locks, unlocks and powers on. Requires the Ítalock app on the watch with its screen lock turned on. Away from the phone, it goes through Google\'s internet service. Risk: anyone with your unlocked watch can unlock.</string>
    <string name="exp_footer">After turning one on, choose the computers in each computer\'s details. Turning it off here turns it off for all.</string>

